        "description": "Twarabaiye hamwe ivyabaye kuri Yona amaze gutererwa mu kiyaga. Twabonyeko yaciye amigwa n'urufi runini. Akimigwa n'urwo rufi, twanyeko Yona yaciye asenga Imana yiwe iramwumva. Mugusenga kwiwe, yaszeraniye Uhoraho ibintu vyinshi harimwo no kuja I Ninewe. Yona yashinze intaheavuga ko agakiza kava k'Uhoraho. Twarabonye amungane atatu avuga ku gakiza ariyo : Narakijijwe, ndakizwa, nzokizwa. Yona adashwe n'urufi, yasubiye i musozi . Twabonye ko Imana ar'Imana y'amahirwe ya kabiri, Imana yongeye gutuma Yona i Ninewe.",
